{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09576","headline":"至大梁却寄匡城主人 · 岑参","name":"至大梁却寄匡城主人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一从弃鱼钓，十载干明王。\n无由谒天阶，却欲归沧浪。\n仲秋至东郡，遂见天雨霜。\n昨日梦故山，蕙草色已黄。\n平明辞铁丘，薄暮游大梁。\n仲秋萧条景，拔刺飞鹅鶬。\n四郊阴气闭，万里无晶光。\n长风吹白茅，野火烧枯桑。\n故人南燕吏，籍籍名更香。\n聊以玉壶赠，置之君子堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09576.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09576","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}